      "ai": {"range": [2.5, 7.5]}},
    "through_the_veil": {"name": "Through the Veil", "category": "utility", "use": "ability2",
      "short": "Sink through the floor and rise 3.2 m away in a pulse",
      "desc": "Knell sinks out of the world and resurfaces 3.2 metres away in the direction of the stick, untouchable while he is gone, then rises in a spectral pulse that shoves and Haunts anyone close. It escapes a corner or a beating; a fighter who reads where he will come up can be waiting there.",
